  "sourceTitle": "Garlic Noodles",
  "sourceText": "Garlic Noodles\nBy: Helen Pitlick\nPublished: Friday, December 10, 2010 - 1:02am\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n3 cups cooked noodles\n2 tablespoons olive oil\n3 large garlic cloves, minced\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Cook noodles just before making. Keep warm. Saute garlic in oil to release oils. Toss with noodles.\n\nAbout\n\n\nUse your favorite type of noodle; add cooked vegetables or meat.",
